# Vendored deps: ship the wheels (offline artifact), not the extracted tree.
# `vendor/_lib/` is regenerated from vendor/wheels/ on first run (or via
# `make install-bundled`) — no need to commit ~500 unpacked third-party files.
vendor/_lib/

